structureKeys
  dryingShed
  sawmill
  lumberYard
  foresterCamp
  merchantStall
  sapShrine
  resinLab
  railDepot

structureLabel
  dryingShed => Drying Shed
  sawmill => Sawmill
  lumberYard => Lumber Yard
  foresterCamp => Forester Camp
  merchantStall => Merchant Stall
  sapShrine => Shrine of Sap
  resinLab => Resin Lab
  railDepot => Rail Depot

structureDescription
  dryingShed => Converts logs into dry timber worth more money.
  sawmill => Processes raw logs automatically and unlocks plank contracts.
  lumberYard => Raises storage and improves base sale price.
  foresterCamp => Unlocks worker AI hires and tree scouting.
  merchantStall => Creates rotating premium sale windows and contracts.
  sapShrine => Grants combo blessings, crit luck and stamina bursts.
  resinLab => Unlocks resin extraction and advanced upgrades.
  railDepot => Massively improves large contract rewards and shipping.

structureEffect
  dryingShed => +1 processed lumber every 18s
  sawmill => Passive log conversion and worker boost
  lumberYard => +25 storage and better market floor
  foresterCamp => Hire autonomous helpers
  merchantStall => Market surges and broker tasks
  sapShrine => Combo decay slowed, crit rate up
  resinLab => Trees sometimes drop resin
  railDepot => Bulk order multiplier

