  rookieLogger => Rookie Logger
  muleDriver => Mule Driver
  treeScout => Tree Scout
  marketBroker => Market Broker
  machineOperator => Machine Operator
  forestWarden => Forest Warden

workerDescription
  rookieLogger => Chops nearby small trees and brings back logs.
  muleDriver => Hauls extra storage and helps auto-sell overflow.
  treeScout => Marks high-value trees and improves regrowth targeting.
  marketBroker => Finds premium contracts and better sale moments.
  machineOperator => Improves sawmill throughput and crafted output.
  forestWarden => Protects the ecosystem and sharply boosts tree quality.

