recipeKeys
  bundle
  planks
  treated
  resinKit

recipeLabel
  bundle => Log Bundle
  planks => Planed Planks
  treated => Treated Timber
  resinKit => Resin Tap Kit

recipeDescription
  bundle => Bulk ship ten logs at once for a cleaner margin.
  planks => Process logs into building-grade lumber.
  treated => Dry and treat lumber for premium resale.
  resinKit => Improves resin extraction chance on rare trees.

aiTips
  Start with Swing Speed and storage before chasing big contracts.
  Reserve logs early so you can unlock the first structure quickly.
  Build the Forester Camp before overinvesting in manual chopping.
  A Lumber Yard is the safest early economy stabilizer.
  Use Sawmills when your log intake is faster than your market sales.
  Merchant Stall shines once contracts become your main income.
  Reforestation protects long-term output when workers scale up.
  Forest Warden is expensive, but boosts quality and regrowth synergy.

contractTemplates
  Deliver [contractAmount] [contractTree] logs in [contractTime] days for [contractReward] coins.
  Clear [contractAmount] damaged [contractTree] trees before sunset for [contractReward] coins.
  Supply the village yard with [contractAmount] bundles of [contractTree] timber for [contractReward] coins.
  Rush-order [contractAmount] high-grade [contractTree] lumber for [contractReward] coins.
  Emergency rebuild: provide [contractAmount] logs in [contractTime] days for [contractReward] coins.

